{"text":"<span><br /><br /><br />https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=I6-WlTWTG5c<br /><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7.046144\">00:07</span>  ### 1-1. Kusalattika-hetudukaṃ ^7-50-0 </span><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span>#### 1. Hetupadaṃ ^7-50a-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-50b-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayā </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12.734547\">00:12</span> 1. Kusalaṃ hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo hetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. ^7-50b-1<br /><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"22.240408\">00:22</span> Akusalaṃ hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo hetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"29.215712\">00:29</span> Abyākataṃ hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato hetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"36.820298\">00:36</span> 2. Kusalaṃ hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo hetu dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1) ^7-50b-2 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"43.372433\">00:43</span> Akusalaṃ hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo hetu dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"50.399543\">00:50</span> Abyākataṃ hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato hetu dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"58.761461\">00:58</span> 3. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā tīṇi, anantare tīṇi, samanantare tīṇi, sahajāte tīṇi, aññamaññe tīṇi, nissaye tīṇi, upanissaye tīṇi, purejāte tīṇi, āsevane tīṇi, kamme tīṇi, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre tīṇi…pe… avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50b-3\n##### Paccanīyaṃ –naadhipatipaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"83.081664\">01:23</span> 4. Kusalaṃ hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo hetu dhammo uppajjati naadhipatipaccayā. (1) ^7-50b-4 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"90.869441\">01:30</span> Akusalaṃ hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo hetu dhammo uppajjati naadhipatipaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"98.434617\">01:38</span> Abyākataṃ hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato hetu dhammo uppajjati naadhipatipaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"107.258036\">01:47</span> 5. Naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, navippayutte tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50b-5 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"119.904719\">01:59</span> Hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nNaadhipatipaccayā hetuyā tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Sahajātavārepi paccayavārepi nissayavārepi saṃsaṭṭhavārepi sampayuttavārepi sabbattha tīṇi.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-50c-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetuārammaṇapaccayādi </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"139.114594\">02:19</span> 6. Kusalo hetu dhammo kusalassa hetussa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-50c-6\n\nAkusalo hetu dhammo akusalassa hetussa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1)\n\nAbyākato hetu dhammo abyākatassa hetussa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"161.38628\">02:41</span> 7. Kusalo hetu dhammo kusalassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Kusalo hetu dhammo akusalassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Kusalo hetu dhammo abyākatassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (3) ^7-50c-7 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"182.637684\">03:02</span> Akusalo hetu dhammo akusalassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"191.084382\">03:11</span> Abyākato hetu dhammo abyākatassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"199.809138\">03:19</span> 8. Kusalo hetu dhammo kusalassa hetussa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. Kusalo hetu dhammo akusalassa hetussa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. Kusalo hetu dhammo abyākatassa hetussa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-50c-8 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"218.606125\">03:38</span> Akusalo hetu dhammo akusalassa hetussa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. (1)</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"225.340259\">03:45</span> Abyākato hetu dhammo abyākatassa hetussa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. Abyākato hetu dhammo kusalassa hetussa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. Abyākato hetu dhammo akusalassa hetussa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Anantarapaccayādi </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"240.320761\">04:00</span> 9. Kusalo hetu dhammo kusalassa hetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo… dve. ^7-50c-9</span></p><p><span><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"253.967927\">04:13</span> Akusalo hetu dhammo akusalassa hetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo… dve.\n </span></p><p><span><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"261.855244\">04:21</span> Abyākato hetu dhammo abyākatassa hetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo (1)</span></p><p><span><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"271.884646\">04:31</span> 10. Kusalo hetu dhammo kusalassa hetussa dhammassa sahajātapaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-50c-10<br /><br />Akusalo hetu dhammo akusalassa hetussa dhammassa sahajātapaccayena paccayo. (1)<br /><br />Abyākato hetu dhammo abyākatassa hetussa dhammassa sahajātapaccayena paccayo. (1)\n\n(Aññamaññanissayapaccayā sahajātapaccayasadisā).</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Upanissayapaccayādi</span></p><p><span><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"278.87429\">04:38</span> 11. Kusalo hetu dhammo kusalassa hetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo. Kusalo hetu dhammo akusalassa hetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo. Kusalo hetu dhammo abyākatassa hetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo. (3) ^7-50c-11</span></p><p><span><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"300.396658\">05:00</span> Akusalo hetu dhammo akusalassa hetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo. Akusalo hetu dhammo kusalassa hetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo. Akusalo hetu dhammo abyākatassa hetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. (3)</span></p><p><span><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"315.101783\">05:15</span> Abyākato hetu dhammo abyākatassa hetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo. Abyākato hetu dhammo kusalassa hetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo. Abyākato hetu dhammo akusalassa hetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo. (3) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"336.900488\">05:36</span> Abyākato hetu dhammo abyākatassa hetussa dhammassa vipākapaccayena paccayo. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.)</span></p><p><span><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"343.997178\">05:43</span> 12. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā satta, anantare pañca, samanantare pañca, sahajāte tīṇi, aññamaññe tīṇi, nissaye tīṇi, upanissaye nava, āsevane tīṇi, vipāke ekaṃ, indriye dve, magge dve, sampayutte tīṇi, atthiyā tīṇi, natthiyā pañca, vigate pañca, avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50c-12 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccanīyuddhāro </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"372.487561\">06:12</span> 13. Kusalo hetu dhammo kusalassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo. Kusalo hetu dhammo akusalassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo. Kusalo hetu dhammo abyākatassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo. (3) ^7-50c-13</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"408.492236\">06:48</span> Akusalo hetu dhammo akusalassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo. Akusalo hetu dhammo kusalassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo. Akusalo hetu dhammo abyākatassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo. (3) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"445.08765\">07:25</span> Abyākato hetu dhammo abyākatassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… sahajātapaccayena paccayo… upanissayapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ).</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"457.045486\">07:37</span> 14. Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50c-14\n\nHetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nNahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvārassa anulomampi paccanīyampi anulomapaccanīyampi paccanīyānulomampi gaṇitaṃ, evaṃ gaṇetabbaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 2. Nahetupadaṃ ^7-50d-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-50e-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayā </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"482.310735\">08:02</span> 15. Kusalaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Kusalaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Kusalaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo nahetu ca abyākato nahetu ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-50e-15 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"511.519458\">08:31</span> Akusalaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Akusalaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Akusalaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo nahetu ca abyākato nahetu ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"538.723891\">08:58</span> Abyākataṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"547.657496\">09:07</span> Kusalaṃ nahetuñca abyākataṃ nahetuñca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"558.001462\">09:18</span> Akusalaṃ nahetuñca abyākataṃ nahetuñca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"568.898665\">09:28</span> 16. Kusalaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo nahetu dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1) ^7-50e-16 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"577.086679\">09:37</span> Akusalaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo nahetu dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"585.220178\">09:45</span> Abyākataṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato nahetu dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā (1) (saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"594.039808\">09:54</span> 17. Hetuyā nava, ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā nava, anantare tīṇi, samanantare tīṇi, sahajāte nava, aññamaññe tīṇi, nissaye nava, upanissaye tīṇi, purejāte tīṇi, āsevane tīṇi, kamme nava, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre nava, indriye nava, jhāne nava, magge nava, sampayutte tīṇi, vippayutte nava, atthiyā nava, natthiyā tīṇi, vigate tīṇi, avigate nava (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50e-17</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Nahetunaārammaṇapaccayādi </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"627.920307\">10:27</span> 18. Abyākataṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato nahetu dhammo uppajjati nahetupaccayā. (1) ^7-50e-18 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"640.258374\">10:40</span> Kusalaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato nahetu dhammo uppajjati naārammaṇapaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"648.359034\">10:48</span> Akusalaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato nahetu dhammo uppajjati naārammaṇapaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"661.82794\">11:01</span> Abyākataṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato nahetu dhammo uppajjati naārammaṇapaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"671.080821\">11:11</span> Kusalaṃ nahetuñca abyākataṃ nahetuñca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato nahetu dhammo uppajjati naārammaṇapaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"682.080402\">11:22</span> Akusalaṃ nahetuñca abyākataṃ nahetuñca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato nahetu dhammo uppajjati naārammaṇapaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"693.592201\">11:33</span> 19. Nahetuyā ekaṃ, naārammaṇe pañca, naadhipatiyā nava, naanantare pañca, nasamanantare pañca, naaññamaññe pañca, naupanissaye pañca, napurejāte satta, napacchājāte nava, naāsevane nava, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke nava, naāhāre ekaṃ, naindriye ekaṃ, najhāne ekaṃ, namagge ekaṃ, nasampayutte pañca, navippayutte tīṇi, nonatthiyā pañca, novigate pañca (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50e-19 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"734.951834\">12:14</span> Hetupaccayā naārammaṇe pañca (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nNahetupaccayā ārammaṇe ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Sahajātavārampi paccayavārampi nissayavārampi saṃsaṭṭhavārampi sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisā vitthāretabbā.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-50f-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Ārammaṇapaccayādi </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"755.688379\">12:35</span> 20. Kusalo nahetu dhammo kusalassa nahetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Kusalo nahetu dhammo akusalassa nahetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Kusalo nahetu dhammo abyākatassa nahetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (3) ^7-50f-20 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"781.708525\">13:01</span> Akusalo nahetu dhammo akusalassa nahetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Akusalo nahetu dhammo kusalassa nahetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Akusalo nahetu dhammo abyākatassa nahetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (3) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"804.011019\">13:24</span> Abyākato nahetu dhammo abyākatassa nahetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Abyākato nahetu dhammo kusalassa nahetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Abyākato nahetu dhammo akusalassa nahetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (3) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"826.375579\">13:46</span> 21. Kusalo nahetu dhammo kusalassa nahetussa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. Kusalo nahetu dhammo akusalassa nahetussa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. Kusalo nahetu dhammo abyākatassa nahetussa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. Kusalo nahetu dhammo kusalassa nahetussa ca ab</span><span>yākatassa nahetussa ca dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo… cattāri. ^7-50f-21 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"842.25401\">14:02</span> Akusalo nahetu dhammo akusalassa nahetussa dhammassa adhipatipaccaye</span><span>na paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"849.51608\">14:09</span><span> Abyākato nahetu dhammo abyākatassa nahetussa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. Abyākato nahetu dhammo kusalassa nahetussa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"868.718896\">14:28</span><span> 22. Kusalo nahetu dhammo kusalassa nahetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo. Kusalo nahetu dhammo abyākatassa nahetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo. (2) ^7-50f-22 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"888.345872\">14:48</span><span> Akusalo nahetu dhammo akusalassa nahetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo. Akusalo nahetu dhammo abyākatassa nahetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo. (2)\n\nAbyākato nahetu dhammo abyākatassa nahetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi…pe….</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Upanissayapaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"912.882265\">15:12</span><span> 23. Kusalo nahetu dhammo kusalassa nahetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo. Kusalo nahetu dhammo akusalassa nahetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo. Kusalo nahetu dhammo abyākatassa nahetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo. (3) ^7-50f-23 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"936.629366\">15:36</span><span> Akusalo nahetu dhammo akusalassa nahetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo. Akusalo nahetu dhammo kusalassa nahetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo. Akusalo nahetu dhammo abyākatassa nahetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo. (3) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"958.872835\">15:58</span><span> Abyākato nahetu dhammo abyākatassa nahetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo. Abyākato nahetu dhammo kusalassa nahetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo. Abyākato nahetu dhammo akusalassa nahetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo. (3) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"980.815241\">16:20</span><span> 24. Ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā dasa, anantare satta, samanantare satta, sahajāte nava, aññamaññe tīṇi, nissaye terasa, upanissaye nava, purejāte tīṇi, pacchājāte tīṇi, āsevane tīṇi, kamme satta, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre satta, indriye satta, jhāne satta, magge satta, sampayutte tīṇi, vippayutte pañca, atthiyā terasa, natthiyā satta, vigate satta, avigate terasa (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50f-24 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1020.144593\">17:00</span><span> Nahetuyā pannarasa, naārammaṇe pannarasa (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nĀrammaṇapaccayā nahetuyā nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nNahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1049.822144\">17:29</span><span> #### 2-1. Vedanāttika-hetudukaṃ ^7-50g-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-50h-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1053.858321\">17:33</span> 25. Sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto hetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-50h-25</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1068.089373\">17:48</span> Dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto hetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1083.740822\">18:03</span> Adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto hetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1096.903553\">18:16</span> 26. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā tīṇi…pe… vipāke dve…pe… avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50h-26\n<br /> Naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte dve, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, navippayutte dve (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nHetupaccayā naadhipatiyā tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nNaadhipatipaccayā hetuyā tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi vitthāretabbaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayā </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1129.768821\">18:49</span> 27. Sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto hetu dhammo sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa hetussa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-50h-27</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1144.217136\">19:04</span> Dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto hetu dhammo dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa hetussa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1)</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1155.002149\">19:15</span> Adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto hetu dhammo adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa hetussa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1)</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span>\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1167.049618\">19:27</span> 28. Sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto hetu dhammo sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-50h-28 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1178.848562\">19:38</span> Dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto hetu dhammo dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1190.241007\">19:50</span> Adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto hetu dhammo adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1203.072843\">20:03</span> 29. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā cattāri, anantare cha, samanantare cha, sahajāte tīṇi, aññamaññe tīṇi, nissaye tīṇi, upanissaye nava, āsevane tīṇi, vipāke dve, indriye dve, magge dve, sampayutte tīṇi, atthiyā tīṇi, natthiyā cha, vigate cha, avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50h-29 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1229.089963\">20:29</span> Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nHetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nNahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-50i-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1245.888932\">20:45</span> 30. Sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-50i-30</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1261.148078\">21:01</span> Dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1273.272009\">21:13</span> Adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttaṃ nahetuṃ dham</span></p><p><span>maṃ paṭicca adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1287.256095\">21:27</span><span> 31. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi…pe… avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50i-31\n\nNahetuyā tīṇi, naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte dve, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi…pe… navippayutte dve (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi vitthāretabbaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 7. Pañhāvāro ^7-50j-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Ārammaṇapaccayādi </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1318.366414\">21:58</span><span> 32. Sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto nahetu dhammo sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa nahetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto nahetu dhammo dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa nahetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto nahetu dhammo adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa nahetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (3) ^7-50j-32 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1355.504061\">22:35</span><span> Dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto nahetu dhammo dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa nahetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto nahetu dhammo sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa nahetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto nahetu dhammo adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa nahetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (3) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1389.205218\">23:09</span><span> Adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto nahetu dhammo adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa nahetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto nahetu dhammo sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa nahetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto nahetu dhammo dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa nahetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (3)</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1426.964077\">23:46</span> 33. Sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto nahetu dhammo sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa nahetussa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. Sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto nahetu dhammo adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa nahetussa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. (2) ^7-50j-33 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1449.575715\">24:09</span> Dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto nahetu dhammo dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa nahetussa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. (1)</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1461.29148\">24:21</span> Adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto nahetu dhammo adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa nahetussa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. Adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto nahetu dhammo sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa nahetussa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. (2) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Anantara-upanissayapaccayā </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1485.757147\">24:45</span> 34. Sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto nahetu dhammo sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa nahetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo… dve. ^7-50j-34 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1498.247729\">24:58</span> Dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto nahetu dhammo dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa nahetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo… dve. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1509.519257\">25:09</span> Adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto nahetu dhammo adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa nahetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi…pe…. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1523.353924\">25:23</span> 35. Sukhāya vedanāya sampayutto nahetu dhammo sukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa nahetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-50j-35 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1538.825548\">25:38</span> Dukkhāya vedanāya sampayutto nahetu dhammo dukkhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa nahetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1550.500766\">25:50</span> Adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayutto nahetu dhammo adukkhamasukhāya vedanāya sampayuttassa nahetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1563.34573\">26:03</span> 36. Ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā pañca, anantare satta, samanantare satta, sahajāte tīṇi, aññamaññe tīṇi, nissaye tīṇi, upanissaye nava, āsevane tīṇi, kamme aṭṭha, vipāke tīṇi, āhāre tīṇi, indriye tīṇi, jhāne tīṇi, magge tīṇi, sampayutte tīṇi, atthiyā tīṇi, natthiyā satta, vigate satta, avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50j-36 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1594.958064\">26:34</span> Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nĀrammaṇapaccayā nahetuyā nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nNahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.)\n<br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1619.394013\">26:59</span> </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span>#### 3-1. Vipākattika-hetudukaṃ ^7-50k-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-50l-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1625.097655\">27:05</span> 37. Vipākaṃ hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca vipāko hetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-50l-37 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1635.189657\">27:15</span> Vipākadhammadhammaṃ hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca vipākadhammadhammo hetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"1644.852686\">27:24</span> Nevavipākanavipākadhammadhammaṃ hetuṃ dhammaṃ p