nnupādāniyassa hetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-50q-56</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2501.421647\">41:41</span> Anupādinnupādāniyo hetu dhammo anupādinnupādāniyassa hetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</span></p><p><span><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2512.198475\">41:52</span> Anupādinnaanupādāniyo hetu dhammo anupādinnaanupādāniyassa hetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo. Anupādinnaanupādāniyo hetu dhammo upādinnupādāniyassa hetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo…pe…. (2)</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2532.92728\">42:12</span> 57. Upādinnupādāniyo hetu dhammo upādinnupādāniyassa hetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo. Upādinnupādāniyo hetu dhammo anupādinnupādāniyassa hetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo. Upādinnupādāniyo hetu dhammo anupādinnaanupādāniyassa hetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo. (3) ^7-50q-57</span></p><p><span><br /><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2566.583381\">42:46</span> Anupādinnupādāniyo hetu dhammo anupādinnupādāniyassa hetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2576.720127\">42:56</span> Anupādinnaanupādāniyo hetu dhammo anupādinnaanupādāniyassa hetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2588.341365\">43:08</span> 58. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe pañca, adhipatiyā cattāri, anantare cha, samanantare cha, sahajāte tīṇi, aññamaññe tīṇi, nissaye tīṇi, upanissaye nava, āsevane dve, vipāke dve…pe… avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50q-58 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2607.396435\">43:27</span><span> Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nHetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nNahetupaccayā ārammaṇe pañca (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Nahetupadapaccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2625.029961\">43:45</span><span> 59. Upādinnupādāniyaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādinnupādāniyo nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Upādinnupādāniyaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca anupādinnupādāniyo nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Upādinnupādāniyaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādinnupādāniyo nahetu ca anupādinnupādāniyo nahetu ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) ^7-50q-59 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2663.055595\">44:23</span><span> Anupādinnupādāniyaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca anupādinnupādāniyo nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2673.868689\">44:33</span><span> Anupādinnaanupādāniyaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca anupādinnaanupādāniyo nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Anupādinnaanupādāniyaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca anupādinnupādāniyo nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Anupādinnaanupādāniyaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca anupādinnupādāniyo nahetu ca anupādinnaanupādāniyo nahetu ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3)</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2716.77087\">45:16</span><span> Upādinnupādāniyaṃ nahetuñca anupādinnupādāniyaṃ nahetuñca dhammaṃ paṭicca anupādinnupādāniyo nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2731.084886\">45:31</span><span> Anupādinnupādāniyaṃ nahetuñca anupādinnaanupādāniyaṃ nahetuñca dhammaṃ paṭicca anupādinnupādāniyo nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"2746.324552\">45:46</span><span> 60. Upādinnupādāniyaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca upādinnupādāniyo nahetu dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1) ^7-50q-60 </s