estamp\" data-timestamp=\"7633.558133\">2:07:13</span> 158. Parittaṃ hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca paritto hetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-50-158 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7645.010148\">2:07:25</span> Mahaggataṃ hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca mahaggato hetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7653.551956\">2:07:33</span> Appamāṇaṃ hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca appamāṇo hetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7662.522792\">2:07:42</span> Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi…pe… avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nNaadhipatiyā tīṇi…pe… navippayutte tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetuārammaṇapaccayādi </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7675.779976\">2:07:55</span> 159. Paritto hetu dhammo parittassa hetussa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-50-159 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7682.462822\">2:08:02</span> Mahaggato hetu dhammo mahaggatassa hetussa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7690.34816\">2:08:10</span> Appamāṇo hetu dhammo appamāṇassa hetussa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7698.909666\">2:08:18</span> Paritto hetu dhammo parittassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Paritto hetu dhammo mahaggatassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (2)</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7716.198546\">2:08:36</span> Mahaggato hetu dhammo mahaggatassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Mahaggato hetu dhammo parittassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (2) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7734.819276\">2:08:54</span> Appamāṇo hetu dhammo parittassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Appamāṇo hetu dhammo mahaggatassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (2) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7751.997223\">2:09:11</span> 160. Paritto hetu dhammo parittassa hetussa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-50-160 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7759.763184\">2:09:19</span> Mahaggato hetu dhammo mahaggatassa hetussa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. Mahaggato hetu dhammo parittassa hetussa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo. (2) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7776.277346\">2:09:36</span> Appamāṇo hetu dhammo appamāṇassa hetussa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo… dve. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7785.006238\">2:09:45</span> Paritto hetu dhammo parittassa hetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo. Paritto hetu dhammo mahaggatassa hetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo. Paritto hetu dhammo appamāṇassa hetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo. (3) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7801.634576\">2:10:01</span> Mahaggato hetu dhammo mahaggatassa hetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo. Mahaggato hetu dhammo parittassa hetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo. Mahaggato hetu dhammo appamāṇassa hetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo. (3) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7822.495648\">2:10:22</span> Appamāṇo hetu dhammo appamāṇassa hetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo. Appamāṇo hetu dhammo parittassa hetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo. Appamāṇo hetu dhammo mahaggatassa hetussa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo. (3) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7841.609885\">2:10:41</span> Paritto hetu dhammo parittassa hetussa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7849.39872\">2:10:49</span> 161. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe cha, adhipatiyā pañca, anantare nava, samanantare nava, sahajāte tīṇi, aññamaññe tīṇi, nissaye tīṇi, upanissaye nava…pe… avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50-161 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7865.623355\">2:11:05</span> Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nHetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nNahetupaccayā ārammaṇe cha (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.)</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### Nahetupadaṃ ^7-50-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-6. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-50-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetupaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7883.832354\">2:11:23</span> 162. Parittaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca paritto nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā… tīṇi. ^7-50-162 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7896.357852\">2:11:36</span> Mahaggataṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca mahaggato nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Mahaggataṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca paritto nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Mahaggataṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca paritto nahetu ca mahaggato nahetu ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"7926.628902\">2:12:06</span> Appamāṇaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca appamāṇo nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Appamāṇaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca paritto nahetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. Appamāṇaṃ nahetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca paritto nahetu ca appamāṇo nahetu ca dhammā uppajjanti hetupaccayā. (3) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span