uṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca mahaggatārammaṇo hetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8158.745233\">2:15:58</span> Appamāṇārammaṇaṃ hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca appamāṇārammaṇo hetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8168.378038\">2:16:08</span> Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi…pe… vigate tīṇi, avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8174.493721\">2:16:14</span> Naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, navippayutte tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Sahajātavārampi …pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayā </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8193.110312\">2:16:33</span> 168. Parittārammaṇo hetu dhammo parittārammaṇassa hetussa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-50-168 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8202.031106\">2:16:42</span> Mahaggatārammaṇo hetu dhammo mahaggatārammaṇassa hetussa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8211.461519\">2:16:51</span> Appamāṇārammaṇo hetu dhammo appamāṇārammaṇassa hetussa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8220.654936\">2:17:00</span> Parittārammaṇo hetu dhammo parittārammaṇassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Parittārammaṇo hetu dhammo mahaggatārammaṇassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (2) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"8240.310069\">2:17:20</span> Mahaggatārammaṇo hetu dhammo mahaggatārammaṇassa hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Mahaggatārammaṇo hetu dhammo parittārammaṇassa hetussa dhammass