taṃ). ^7-50Â-243\n\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11703.687489\">3:15:03</span> Ārammaṇe tīṇi, adhipatiyā nava, anantare ekaṃ, samanantare ekaṃ, sahajāte ekavīsa…pe… avigate pañcavīsa (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11717.543761\">3:15:17</span> Nahetuyā pañcavīsa, naārammaṇe ekavīsa (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nĀrammaṇapaccayā nahetuyā tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nNahetupaccayā ārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ).\n\nSanidassanasappaṭighattikahetudukaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11743.768134\">3:15:43</span> #### 1-2. Kusalattika-sahetukadukaṃ ^7-50Ã-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-50Ä-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetupaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11752.508387\">3:15:52</span> 244. Kusalaṃ sahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo sahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-50Ä-244 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11762.427809\">3:16:02</span> Akusalaṃ sahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo sahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11770.73881\">3:16:10</span> Abyākataṃ sahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato sahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11780.230514\">3:16:20</span> 245. Hetuyā tīṇi…pe… avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50Ä-245 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11783.15949\">3:16:23</span> Naadhipatiyā tīṇi, napurejāte tīṇi, napacchājāte tīṇi, naāsevane tīṇi, nakamme tīṇi, navipāke tīṇi, navippayutte tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11799.456653\">3:16:39</span> Hetupaccayā naadhipatiyā tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nNaadhipatipaccayā hetuyā tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayā </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11812.441109\">3:16:52</span> 246. Kusalo sahetuko dhammo kusalassa sahetukassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-50Ä-246 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11820.199054\">3:17:00</span> Akusalo sahetuko dhammo akusalassa sahetukassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1)</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11828.59845\">3:17:08</span> Abyākato sahetuko dhammo abyākatassa sahetukassa dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11838.133312\">3:17:18</span> Kusalo sahetuko dhammo kusalassa sahetukassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Kusalo sahetuko dhammo akusalassa sahetukassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. Kusalo sahetuko dhammo abyākatassa sahetukassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (3) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11862.806209\">3:17:42</span> Akusalo sahetuko dhammo akusalassa sahetukassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. (3) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11871.923618\">3:17:51</span> Abyākato sahetuko dhammo abyākatassa sahetukassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. (3) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11881.941002\">3:18:01</span> Kusalo sahetuko dhammo kusalassa sahetukassa dhammassa adhipatipaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11890.146954\">3:18:10</span> 247. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā satta, anantare pañca, samanantare pañca, sahajāte tīṇi, aññamaññe tīṇi, nissaye tīṇi, upanissaye nava…pe… avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50Ä-247 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11905.887091\">3:18:25</span> Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nHetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nNahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.)</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### Ahetukapadaṃ ^7-50Å-0</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-50Æ-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### Paccayacatukkaṃ ^7-50Ç-0</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetuārammaṇapaccayā </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11923.534489\">3:18:43</span><span> 248. Akusalaṃ ahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato ahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-50Ç-248 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11935.171771\">3:18:55</span><span> Abyākataṃ ahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato ahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11944.603143\">3:19:04</span><span> Akusalaṃ ahetukañca abyākataṃ ahetukañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato ahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11955.022356\">3:19:15</span><span> Abyākataṃ ahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato ahetuko dhammo uppajjati ārammaṇapaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"11964.627084\">3:19:24</span><span> 249. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe ekaṃ, adhipatiyā ekaṃ…pe… avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50Ç-249 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### Paccanīyaṃ ^7-50È-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Nahetu-naārammaṇapaccayā </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timesta