aṇapaccayena paccayo. Abyākato ahetuko dhammo akusalassa ahetukassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo. (2) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12083.201121\">3:21:23</span><span> Akusalo ahetuko dhammo akusalassa ahetukassa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo. Akusalo ahetuko dhammo abyākatassa ahetukassa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo. (2) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12099.596836\">3:21:39</span><span> Abyākato ahetuko dhammo abyākatassa ahetukassa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo. Abyākato ahetuko dhammo akusalassa ahetukassa dhammassa anantarapaccayena paccayo…pe…. (2) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12116.586278\">3:21:56</span><span> Akusalo ahetuko dhammo akusalassa ahetukassa dhammassa upanissayapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12124.905467\">3:22:04</span><span> 252. Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe cattāri, anantare cattāri, samanantare cattāri, sahajāte tīṇi, aññamaññe ekaṃ, nissaye cattāri, upanissaye cattāri (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50È-252 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12138.675139\">3:22:18</span><span> Nahetuyā pañca, naārammaṇe pañca, naadhipatiyā pañca (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nHetupaccayā naārammaṇe ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nNahetupaccayā ārammaṇe cattāri (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-3. Kusalattika-hetusampayuttadukaṃ ^7-50É-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #</span><span>### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-50Ê-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span>#### Hetupaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12157.828624\">3:22:37</span><span> 253. Kusalaṃ hetusampayuttaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicc