athā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### Sahetukanahetupadaṃ ^7-50Ï-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-50Ð-0</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetupaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12715.88924\">3:31:55</span><span> 267. Kusalaṃ sahetukañceva na ca hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo sahetuko ceva na ca hetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-50Ð-267 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12730.064714\">3:32:10</span><span> Akusalaṃ sahetukañceva na ca hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo sahetuko ceva na ca hetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12740.580677\">3:32:20</span><span> Abyākataṃ sahetukañceva na ca hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato sahetuko ceva na ca hetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12751.877172\">3:32:31</span><span> 268. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi…pe… avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50Ð-268 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12756.478427\">3:32:36</span><span> Naadhipatiyā tīṇi…pe… navippayutte tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Ārammaṇapaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12765.068938\">3:32:45</span><span> 269. Kusalo sahetuko ceva na ca hetu dhammo kusalassa sahetukassa ceva na ca hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-50Ð-269 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12779.311782\">3:32:59</span><span> Akusalo sahetuko ceva na ca hetu dhammo akusalassa sahetukassa ceva na ca hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12790.767649\">3:33:10</span><span> Abyākato sahetuko ceva na ca hetu dhammo abyākatassa sahetukassa ceva na ca hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12803.143251\">3:33:23</span><span> 270. Ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā satta, anantare pañca…pe… sahajāte tīṇi…pe… upanissaye nava…pe… avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50Ð-270 </span></p><p></p><p><br /></p><p><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12812.706326\">3:33:32</span><span> Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nĀrammaṇapaccayā nahetuyā nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nNahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.)</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span>#### 1-5. Kusalattika-hetuhetusampayuttadukaṃ ^7-50Ñ-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span>#### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-50Ò-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetupaccayo</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span>\n<span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12830.244092\">3:33:50</span> 271. Kusalaṃ hetuñceva hetusampayuttañca dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo hetu ceva hetusampayutto ca dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-50Ò-271</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12844.024088\">3:34:04</span> Akusalaṃ hetuñceva hetusampayuttañca dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo hetu ceva hetusampayutto ca dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12854.870872\">3:34:14</span> Abyākataṃ hetuñceva hetusampayuttañca dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato hetu ceva hetusampayutto ca dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12867.101813\">3:34:27</span> 272. Hetuyā tīṇi…pe… avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50Ò-272\n\nNaadhipatiyā tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nHetupaccayā naadhipatiyā tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nNaadhipatipaccayā hetuyā tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetu-ārammaṇapaccayā </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12888.062337\">3:34:48</span> 273. Kusalo hetu ceva hetusampayutto ca dhammo kusalassa hetussa ceva hetusampayuttassa ca dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) ^7-50Ò-273 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12901.871832\">3:35:01</span> Akusalo hetu ceva hetusampayutto ca dhammo akusalassa hetussa ceva hetusampayuttassa ca dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12912.599443\">3:35:12</span> Abyākato hetu ceva hetusampayutto ca dhammo abyākatassa hetussa ceva hetusampayuttassa ca dhammassa hetupaccayena paccayo. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12924.103618\">3:35:24</span> Kusalo hetu ceva hetusampayutto ca dhammo kusalassa hetussa ceva hetusampayuttassa ca dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ).</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12934.600331\">3:35:34</span> 274. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā satta, anantare pañca…pe… avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50Ò-274 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12944.14535\">3:35:44</span> Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nHetupaccayā naārammaṇe tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nNahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### Hetusampayuttanahetupadaṃ ^7-50Ó-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-50Ô-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetupaccayo</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12961.162707\">3:36:01</span> 275. Kusalaṃ hetusampayuttañceva na ca hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo hetusampayutto ceva na ca hetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-50Ô-275</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12976.471818\">3:36:16</span> Akusalaṃ hetusampayuttañceva na ca hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo hetusampayutto ceva na ca hetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1)</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"12987.863522\">3:36:27</span> Abyākataṃ hetusampayuttañceva na ca hetuṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato hetusampayutto ceva na ca hetu dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ).</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13000.382844\">3:36:40</span> 276. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi…pe… avigate tīṇi. ^7-50Ô-276\n\nNaadhipatiyā tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Ārammaṇapaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13012.677146\">3:36:52</span> 277. Kusalo hetusampayutto ceva na ca hetu dhammo kusalassa hetusampayuttassa ceva na ca hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-50Ô-277 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13028.637741\">3:37:08</span> Akusalo hetusampayutto ceva na ca hetu dhammo akusalassa hetusampayuttassa ceva na ca hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi.</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13041.980033\">3:37:21</span> Abyākato hetusampayutto ceva na ca hetu dhammo abyākatassa hetusampayuttassa ceva na ca hetussa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13056.328079\">3:37:36</span> 278. Ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā satta, anantare pañca…pe… sahajāte tīṇi…pe… upanissaye nava…pe… avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50Ô-278 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13066.196645\">3:37:46</span> Nahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nĀrammaṇapaccayā nahetuyā nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nNahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.)</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-6. Kusalattika-nahetusahetukadukaṃ ^7-50Õ-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### 1-7. Paṭiccavārādi ^7-50Ö-0 </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #</span><span>#### Paccayacatukkaṃ </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetupaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13083.839857\">3:38:03</span><span> 279. Kusalaṃ nahetuṃ sahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca kusalo nahetu sahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) ^7-50Ö-279 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13096.719018\">3:38:16</span><span> Akusalaṃ nahetuṃ sahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca akusalo nahetu sahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13106.074668\">3:38:26</span><span> Abyākataṃ nahetuṃ sahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato nahetu sahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā. (1) (Saṃkhittaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13116.267383\">3:38:36</span><span> 280. Hetuyā tīṇi, ārammaṇe tīṇi…pe… avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50Ö-280\n\nNaadhipatiyā tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ.)</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Ārammaṇapaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13127.975842\">3:38:47</span><span> 281. Kusalo nahetu sahetuko dhammo kusalassa nahetussa sahetukassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. ^7-50Ö-281 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13137.668719\">3:38:57</span><span> Akusalo nahetu sahetuko dhammo akusalassa nahetussa sahetukassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi. </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13147.959517\">3:39:07</span><span> Abyākato nahetu sahetuko dhammo abyākatassa nahetussa sahetukassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo… tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13158.814487\">3:39:18</span><span> 282. Ārammaṇe nava, adhipatiyā satta, anantare pañca…pe… sahajāte aññamaññe nissaye tīṇi, upanissaye nava, āsevane tīṇi, kamme pañca, vipāke ekaṃ, āhāre…pe… sampayutte tīṇi…pe… avigate tīṇi (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50Ö-282\n\nNahetuyā nava, naārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nĀrammaṇapaccayā nahetuyā nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nNahetupaccayā ārammaṇe nava (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.) </span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> #### Nahetuahetukapadaṃ ^7-50×-0</span></p><p><span><br /></span></p><p><span> ##### Hetupaccayo </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13184.825597\">3:39:44</span><span> 283. Abyākataṃ nahetuṃ ahetukaṃ dhammaṃ paṭicca abyākato nahetu ahetuko dhammo uppajjati hetupaccayā (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50×-283 </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13198.718222\">3:39:58</span><span> Hetuyā ekaṃ, ārammaṇe ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\nNahetuyā ekaṃ…pe… novigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Sahajātavārampi…pe… sampayuttavārampi paṭiccavārasadisaṃ.) </span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13213.289278\">3:40:13</span><span> 284. Abyākato nahetu ahetuko dhammo abyākatassa nahetussa ahetukassa dhammassa ārammaṇapaccayena paccayo (saṃkhittaṃ). ^7-50×-284</span></p><p><br /></p><p><span></span><span class=\"timestamp\" data-timestamp=\"13223.647852\">3:40:23</span><span> Ārammaṇe ekaṃ, adhipatiyā ekaṃ…pe… avigate ekaṃ (saṃkhittaṃ).\n\n(Yathā kusalattike pañhāvāraṃ, evaṃ vitthāretabbaṃ.)\n\nHetugocchakaṃ niṭṭhitaṃ.</span></p>","media-time":13012.677146}